msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Nice room you got here.⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Though I guess that’s only natural—⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫"
"⟪k:24⟫you being ⟪k:25⟫the man of the house⟪k:26⟫ and all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Belo quarto você tem aqui. ⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫Embora eu ache que isso seja natural—⟪k:22⟫"
"⟪k:23⟫você sendo ⟪k:24⟫o homem da casa⟪k:25⟫ e tudo mais."

