msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Bem, sim, mas eu ainda quero ouvir ⟪k:1⟫você⟪k:2⟫ dizer isso, sabe?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D0928CDF_1AAF_4059_8987_0C6AC9575F43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad5c5b66ac4ae813679973ec478ccc50f6a4ddfd41d61f52162c74051acb0037
