msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pffft, ⟪k:1⟫baha, ⟪k:2⟫hahahaha...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Vá em frente, diga alguma coisa.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Suba "
