#: scenario3:scenario3_17D4883B_50CA_4CDD_BC6E_79BE38110923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3951d47c78b9d7c312c3b43b569a357d140fb0e8d5fba5609896fa200a84d837
