msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_17D4883B_50CA_4CDD_BC6E_79BE38110923"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’d been trying to figure out how I wanted to end things,⟪k:1⟫but then they just fell apart "
"on their own!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The fates are smiling down upon me, I guess."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu estava tentando decidir como eu queria terminar as coisas,⟪k:1⟫mas então elas "
"simplesmente desmoronaram por conta própria!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫O destino está sorrindo para mim, eu acho."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B32415B3_4781_4156_8438_980EBF5EEB06
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c84f2c1c3079095e922e616b2df5a1d0c678c3b4b0142cc9ded2ba581113d9f0
