msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74FEB0BA_DF3D_4B4B_9CF3_6D6C99B316E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I was going to see her on that day!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You knew the ceremony had been postponed!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E eu ia vê-la naquele dia!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você sabia que a cerimônia havia sido adiada!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B308381D_45D0_43B4_B42A_3BD6AC1A950E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fdcbd3fab5f563bde3cb9bf668c0ae96a97cb5a6074e42a57c0a40b45cad4d0
#. default-sha256: 46b982728f903d0dd443c1cb28e1e59c3e3dac953a4ad87829c49a5e21feb420
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B308381D_45D0_43B4_B42A_3BD6AC1A950E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s what you get for putting it all in my hands.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For thinking I’m the only one "
"on your side!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Isso é o que você ganha por colocar tudo em minhas mãos.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Por pensar que sou a única "
"do seu lado!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3772CF40_5419_4C29_BF90_777C82D925CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8d596d9ab04629bb8281d1f8cf9936a7cae9d7af96161ca22a159d00ff521c0
#. default-sha256: 2ddc61d87148c945629ea8c409fd6e6d6ac3bfc631fe36f0daa6f871cd045933
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3772CF40_5419_4C29_BF90_777C82D925CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What, did you think I’d just ⟪k:1⟫tell her⟪k:2⟫ like a good little maid?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Not a "
"chance in ⟪k:6⟫hell⟪k:7⟫!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O que, você achou que eu ia ⟪k:1⟫dizer para ela⟪k:2⟫ como uma boa empregadinha?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫Sem ⟪k:6⟫nenhuma⟪k:7⟫ chance!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2382AE51_E38B_46FF_A150_DB470F0C78E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1a982c9bb841375f4177e9aedf5a09f3622874a46781146c89b0ebaf4657889
#. default-sha256: 68c3cf97363307cd4f2115235beb72d67f31d387c9acbe277c82fda9f186f346
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2382AE51_E38B_46FF_A150_DB470F0C78E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I mean, talk about some ⟪k:1⟫fantastic⟪k:2⟫ news.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You both pick the same day, but "
"you’ve got the dates different!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quero dizer, que notícia ⟪k:1⟫fantástica⟪k:2⟫.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Vocês dois escolhem o mesmo dia, mas "
"vocês tinham as datas diferentes!"

